  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: Japanese elementary vocabulary illustrations, sheet 55. Edit the provided 2048x2048 template, painting ONLY inside its sixteen white panels. Every single panel MUST have identical width and height. All horizontal lines must be EXACTLY at 0%,25%,50%,75%,100%, not based on artwork. Keep precisely the 4x4 equal grid and 5 continuous pure magenta #ff00ff lines in each direction, including outer frame. Preserve line position, width and full canvas. Each panel is an independent clear gentle picture-book illustration as isolated vignettes on a pure white background, large and easily understood. Never use magenta for illustration. Avoid all pink, purple and neon colors in artwork, objects, decorations, lighting and shadows. Use warm orange, red, yellow, green, blue and neutral colors. No pink/purple concert lights. Nothing crosses the grid. No text, letters, numbers, labels, symbols resembling writing or watermarks. For abstract words show a concrete situation illustrating the meaning. Diverse natural children and adults, no stereotypes. Correct anatomy and objects. Panels in strict row-major order (left to right, top to bottom):\n1. 縮図 — 実物より小さくして形や配置を表した図。\n2. 主語 — 文の中で誰が何がに当たる部分。\n3. 主催 — 中心となって催しを開くこと。\n4. 取材 — 記事や番組のために話を聞いたり調べたりすること。\n5. 主題 — 作品や話の中心となるテーマ。\n6. 首都 — 国の政治の中心となる都市。\n7. 取得 — 資格や権利などを手に入れること。\n8. 種別 — 種類によって分けた区別。\n9. 種目 — 競技などを種類ごとに分けた一つ。\n10. 主役 — 物語や舞台などで中心となる役。\n11. 種類 — 共通する特徴によって分けたまとまり。\n12. 手話 — 手の形や動きや表情などで伝え合う言語。\n13. 将棋 — 盤の上で駒を動かして相手の王を追い詰める遊び。\n14. 正午 — 昼の十二時。\n15. 承知 — 事情などを聞いて分かったり受け入れたりすること。\n16. 消費 — 品物やエネルギーなどを使うこと。\nSafety and clarity: Vehicles must be driven only by unmistakable adults, never children. Industrial machinery and knives are used by adults. Do not put a child in a car driver's seat. Keep artwork separated by the measured template grid.\nDo not add numerical claims, prices, quantities, currency denominations, calorie values or stroke-order numbers unless explicitly required by the target word. Mathematical concepts should have neutral concrete examples without unverified numeric diagrams.\n",
